<title>USA: LodgeNet unit acquires private cable firm.</title>
<headline>LodgeNet unit acquires private cable firm.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS, S.D. 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>LodgeNet Entertainment Corp said Monday its ResNet Communications Inc unit acquired the assets of Home Showtime Inc, a Detroit, Michigan-based private cable television operator, for $4.6 million.</p>
<p>Through the agreement, ResNet acquired 15-year exclusive video services leases covering 36 properties and 11,600 apartment units, LodgeNet, a video-on-demand provider said.</p>
<p>LodgeNet shares were unchanged at 13-3/4 Monday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
